msgid "Intrinsic basis bonding analysis (IAO/IBO)"
msgstr "内禀基组成键分析 (IAO/IBO)"

msgid ""
"The IBBA program is used to perform a chemical bonding analysis of a "
"previously computed Hartree-Fock or Kohn-Sham wave function. Options include"
" the computation of partial charges, bond orders, and localized bond "
"orbitals (i.e., orbitals which correspond to “chemical intuition” bonds). "
"The localized orbitals can be visualized by exporting to ``xml`` files or "
"``molden`` files:"
msgstr ""
"IBBA 程序用于对先前计算的 Hartree-Fock 或 Kohn-Sham "
"波函数进行化学成键分析。选项包括计算部分电荷、键级和定域成键轨道（即对应于“化学直觉”键的轨道）。定域轨道可以通过导出到 ``xml`` 文件或 "
"``molden`` 文件进行可视化："

msgid ""
"Additionally, IBOs can also be used as a general choice for localized "
"molecular orbitals (LMOs), since they are an exact representation of the "
"input determinant wave function (i.e., IBOs are related to canonical "
"occupied orbitals by a unitary transformation). IBOs are a particularly good"
" choice for local correlation methods, since they are both very stable (also"
" in the presence of diffuse basis sets, unlike Pipek-Mezey orbitals) and "
"very fast to compute (faster even than Pipek-Mezey or Boys orbitals). If "
"used as input to subsequent correlation calculations, the *FREEZECORE* "
"directive should be used (see below)."
msgstr ""
"此外，IBO 也可用作定域分子轨道 (LMO) 的通用选择，因为它们是对输入行列式波函数的精确表示（即，IBO 通过酉变换与正则占据轨道相关联）。IBO"
" 是局域相关方法的一个特别好的选择，因为它们既非常稳定（即使在存在弥散基组的情况下，与 Pipek-Mezey 轨道不同），计算速度也非常快（甚至比 "
"Pipek-Mezey 或 Boys 轨道更快）。如果用作后续相关计算的输入，则应使用 *FREEZECORE* 指令（见下文）。"

msgid ""
"Intrinsic bond orbitals (IBOs) and intrinsic atomic orbital charges (IAO "
"charges) can be computed via ``{ibba,option1=value1,option2=value2,…; "
"directive1; directive2, ...}``"
msgstr ""
"内禀成键轨道 (IBO) 和内禀原子轨道电荷 (IAO 电荷) 可以通过 "
"``{ibba,option1=value1,option2=value2,…; directive1; directive2, ...}`` 计算"

msgid "The techniques have been described and validated in"
msgstr "这些技术已在以下文献中描述和验证"

msgid ""
"Knizia, *Intrinsic atomic orbitals: An unbiased bridge between quantum "
"theory and chemical concepts* `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct400687b>`__ **9**, 4834 (2013)"
msgstr ""
"Knizia, *Intrinsic atomic orbitals: An unbiased bridge between quantum "
"theory and chemical concepts* `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct400687b>`__ **9**, 4834 (2013)"

msgid ""
"Knizia, Klein, *Electron Flow in Reaction Mechanisms-Revealed from First "
"Principles* `Angew. Chem. Int. Ed. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/anie.201410637>`__, **54**, 5518 (2015)"
msgstr ""
"Knizia, Klein, *Electron Flow in Reaction Mechanisms-Revealed from First "
"Principles* `Angew. Chem. Int. Ed. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/anie.201410637>`__, **54**, 5518 (2015)"

msgid ""
"The first article should be cited if the IBBA program is used for bonding "
"analysis. The second one should be cited if the program is used for deriving"
" chemical transformations (curly arrows) in reaction mechanisms."
msgstr "若 IBBA 程序用于键合分析，应引用第一篇文献。若程序用于推导反应机理中的化学转化（弯箭头），则应引用第二篇文献。"

msgid "Regular options are:"
msgstr "常规选项有："

msgid ""
"``AO`` Define the minimal AO basis set from which the intrinsic atomic "
"orbitals are built. Defaults to ’MINAO-AUTO-PP’, which is a minimal basis "
"set of spherically averaged Hartree-Fock orbitals (for most elements). This "
"option can be used to change the orbitals which are considered as valence "
"space for individual centers. For example, using this, 4p orbitals of 3d "
"transition metals can be included into the valence space."
msgstr ""
"``AO`` 定义构建本征原子轨道所用的最小原子轨道基组。默认为 'MINAO-AUTO-PP'，这是一个球平均 Hartree-Fock "
"轨道的最小基组（适用于大多数元素）。此选项可用于更改被视为各中心价空间的轨道。例如，使用此选项，可将 3d 过渡金属的 4p 轨道纳入价空间。"

msgid ""
"``BONDS`` Via ``{ibba,bonds=1}`` bond orders between the atoms and valencies"
" of atoms are computed. The bond orders includes both the IAO-generalization"
" of Wiberg bond orders and the (unpublished) renormalized bond orders."
msgstr ""
"``BONDS`` 通过 ``{ibba,bonds=1}`` 计算原子间的键级和原子的价态。键级包括 IAO 推广的 Wiberg "
"键级和（未发表的）重整化键级。"

msgid ""
"``IBORTH`` Defines the orthogonalization method to use. Can be ’SYM’ for "
"Loewdin’s symmetric orthogonalization or ’ZBD’ for Laikov’s zero-bond dipole"
" orthogonalization (if using ZBD, please cite Laikov: "
"http:''dx.doi.org/10.1002/qua.22767). Defaults to ’SYM’. ’ZBD’ "
"orthogonalization may give charges in closer correspondence with "
"electrostatic potentials and chemical intuition, but extensive tests have "
"not yet been performed."
msgstr ""
"``IBORTH`` 定义要使用的正交化方法。可以是 'SYM'（Loewdin 对称正交化）或 'ZBD'（Laikov 的零键偶极正交化，若使用 "
"ZBD，请引用 Laikov：http:''dx.doi.org/10.1002/qua.22767）。默认为 'SYM'。'ZBD' "
"正交化可能使电荷更接近静电势和化学直觉，但尚未进行广泛测试。"

msgid ""
"``IBOEXP`` Exponent to use in the localization functional. Defaults to 4. "
"Allowed values are 2 and 4."
msgstr "``IBOEXP`` 定域化泛函中使用的指数。默认为 4。允许值为 2 和 4。"

msgid ""
"``ANTIBONDS`` If set to 1, IBBA will compute not only localized occupied "
"orbitals, but also localized unoccupied orbitals in the valence space. The "
"localized unoccupied orbitals will typically correspond to the unoccupied "
"anti-bonding orbitals."
msgstr ""
"``ANTIBONDS`` 若设置为 1，IBBA "
"将不仅计算定域的占据轨道，还会计算价空间中的定域非占据轨道。定域的非占据轨道通常对应于非占据的反键轨道。"

msgid "Further specialist options:"
msgstr "进一步的专家选项："

msgid ""
"``THRLOC_IB`` Threshold for convergence of localization. Defaults to 1e-8"
msgstr "``THRLOC_IB`` 定域化收敛阈值。默认为 1e-8"

msgid "``MAXIT_IB`` Maximum number of iterations in localization."
msgstr "``MAXIT_IB`` 定域化中的最大迭代次数。"

msgid ""
"``THRPRINT`` When printing the orbital composition summary, do not list "
"centers with less than this many electrons explicitly. Defaults to 0.02."
msgstr "``THRPRINT`` 打印轨道组成摘要时，不显式列出电子数低于此值的中心。默认为 0.02。"

msgid ""
"``IBOLOC_FACQ`` Factor for charge matrix elements in localization functional"
" (IBO :math:`\\rightarrow` localize charge). Defaults to 1.0"
msgstr "``IBOLOC_FACQ`` 定域化泛函中电荷矩阵元的因子（IBO :math:`\\rightarrow` 定域化电荷）。默认为 1.0"

msgid "Additionally to the options, the following directives are supported:"
msgstr "除了选项之外，还支持以下指令："

msgid "``SAVE`` Defines the record on which the output orbitals are saved"
msgstr "``SAVE`` 定义保存输出轨道的记录"

msgid ""
"``ROTATE`` Defines rotation operations to perform on the input orbitals "
"before localization. See SCF program for reference"
msgstr "``ROTATE`` 定义在定域化之前对输入轨道执行的旋转操作。请参阅 SCF 程序作为参考"

msgid "``CORE`` Defines the number of core orbitals"
msgstr "``CORE`` 定义芯轨道的数量"

msgid ""
"``CLOSED`` Defines the number of closed-shell orbitals (including core "
"orbitals)"
msgstr "``CLOSED`` 定义闭壳层轨道的数量（包括芯轨道）"

msgid ""
"``OCC`` Defines the number of active orbitals. Active orbitals which are not"
" closed are assumed to be singly occupied with alpha spin."
msgstr "``OCC`` 定义活性轨道的数量。未被定义为闭壳层的活性轨道假定为仅被α自旋单占据。"

msgid ""
"``LOCCORE`` See `selecting orbital space "
"<orbital_localization.html#selecting-the-orbital-space>`__."
msgstr ""
"``LOCCORE`` 请参阅 `选择轨道空间 "
"<orbital_localization.html#selectingtheorbitalspace>`__\\ 。"
